{"t":"Crusader Helmet Quest","s":"crusader-helmet-quest-b4304","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Crusader_Helmet_Quest_Map_01_7fd3db.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Crusader Helmet Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"timealloc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Est. Length</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">20 minutes</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">35<br/>(40+ recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>The <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarves\">Dwarves</a> have hidden a shiny helmet deep in their mines, guarded by giant spiders..\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Mines\">Dwarf Mines</a> west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a> or north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32426,31940,14\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32426, 31940, 14)</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf\">Dwarves</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops\">Cyclopses</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">Skeletons</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghouls</a>. <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Soldier\">Dwarf Soldiers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guards</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spiders</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Crusader%20Helmet\">Crusader Helmet</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Equipment\">Required Equipment</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a></li>\n<li>Any melee weapon or a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bug\">firebug</a> to break the <a href=\"#/wiki/Spider%20Web\">spider webs</a> on the way.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<p>There are two routes to the Crusader Helmet, the original route is through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Mines\">Dwarf Mines</a>, but since Updates/8.1 it is also possible to go through <a href=\"#/wiki/Mount%20Sternum\">Mount Sternum</a> and its <a href=\"#/wiki/Mount%20Sternum%2FUndead%20Cave\">Undead Cave</a>, which is faster.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Mount_Sternum_Route\">Mount Sternum Route</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Starting from <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>, head to <a href=\"#/wiki/Mount%20Sternum\">Mount Sternum</a> and go down <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32450,32070,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32450, 32070, 7)</a>.</li>\n<li>Walk north-west, you will face quite some <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops\">Cyclopses</a> and possibly some <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops%20Drone\">Cyclops Drones</a>. Go down <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32418,32041,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32418, 32041, 8)</a>.</li>\n<li>You are now in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Mount%20Sternum%2FUndead%20Cave\">Mount Sternum/Undead Cave</a> and will face <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">Skeletons</a>, walk a little bit north and go down a hole <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32416,32024,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32416, 32024, 9)</a>.</li>\n<li>You will meet <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">Skeletons</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghouls</a>. Walk north-east and go down a hole <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32427,31989,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32427, 31989, 10)</a>.</li>\n<li>You have now entered the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Mines\">Dwarf Mines</a>, you will face 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Soldier\">Dwarf Soldiers</a> when going down and more <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Soldier\">Dwarf Soldiers</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guards</a> when walking further. Walk north and north-east and go down a hole <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32438,31967,11\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32438, 31967, 11)</a>.</li>\n<li>Continue with the last part.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dwarf_Mines_Route\">Dwarf Mines Route</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Head to <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Mines\">Pick 'N Shovel Mine</a> west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>, located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32548,31987,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32548, 31987, 7)</a>.</li>\n<li>Head east and down the hole.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Crusader Helmet Quest Map 01\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"91\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crusader_Helmet_Quest_Map_01_7fd3db.gif\" width=\"125\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Immediately head down another hole and then head far to the west.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Crusader Helmet Quest Map 02\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"102\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crusader_Helmet_Quest_Map_02_b448e6.gif\" width=\"366\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Head to the north and west and continue down another hole.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Crusader Helmet Quest Map 03\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"123\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crusader_Helmet_Quest_Map_03_2f9fc9.gif\" width=\"130\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Continue with the last part.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Last_Part\">Last Part</span></h3>\n<p>Regardless if you took the <i>Mount Sternum Route</i> or the <i>Dwarf Mines Route</i>, the last part is the same.\n</p>\n<ul><li>You will meet <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guards</a>. Head east continuing further down in the mine, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32469,31972,12\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32469, 31972, 12)</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Crusader Helmet Quest Map 04\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crusader_Helmet_Quest_Map_04_27f250.gif\" width=\"140\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>There will be a lot of <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guards</a>. Go north and through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Level\">level</a> 35 gate of expertise.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Crusader Helmet Quest Map 05\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"163\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crusader_Helmet_Quest_Map_05_5ca39b.gif\" width=\"120\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Head down the hole <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32477,31943,13\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32477, 31943, 13)</a> and prepare to face <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spiders</a> (there are 4 in the entire place, but they come one by one, and you should only meet 3 on the way to where the crusader helmet is). There are some <a href=\"#/wiki/Spider%20Web\">spider webs</a> blocking the way. Use a melee weapon or a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bug\">firebug</a> to break it and pass through.</li>\n<li>The reward (a <a href=\"#/wiki/Crusader%20Helmet\">Crusader Helmet</a>) is located in a skeleton body at the far west end of the tunnel, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32426,31940,14\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32426, 31940, 14)</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Crusader Helmet Quest Map 06\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"122\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crusader_Helmet_Quest_Map_06_ae3fc5.gif\" width=\"211\"/></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["sams-old-backpack-quest"]}